                    "sense_definition": "Armed with a weapon, especially a gun.",
                    "learner_level": "C2",
                    "frequency": "Low",
                    "semantic_group_id": "armed",
                    "name_type": "no",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "The security guards were <w>strapped</w> and ready for any potential threat.",
